        "Step 5: Built two reusable prep pipelines: one for numeric columns (fill any gaps with the typical/median value, then rescale everything to a common range) and one for categorical columns (fill gaps with the most common value, then convert text categories into a model-friendly numeric format). Also dropped two id-only columns (Order, PID) that carry no real information about the house."
